WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:08.496
Cora swam back to Mo.

2
00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:14.051
"I know you're scared.

3
00:00:14.052 --> 00:00:17.890
But we have to find Sally's eggs."

4
00:00:17.891 --> 00:00:23.415
Mo took a deep breath.

5
00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:35.836
"Okay, I can do it. Let's go."

6
00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:40.813
They followed the arrow to Riptide Cave.

7
00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:47.009
The cave was dark and creepy.

8
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:51.577
"I don't like this place," Sally said.

9
00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:54.132
"Me neither," Mo said.

10
00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:56.372
"What if we get trapped?"

11
00:00:56.373 --> 00:01:01.888
"Don't be silly," Cora said. "Follow me."

12
00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:06.772
Rumble! Rumble!

13
00:01:06.773 --> 00:01:10.150
A strong wave pushed them in.

14
00:01:10.151 --> 00:01:15.251
"Hold on to me!" Cora yelled.

15
00:01:15.252 --> 00:01:19.224
She used her suckers to grab a rock.

16
00:01:19.225 --> 00:01:22.397
Water rushed past everyone.

17
00:01:22.398 --> 00:01:25.714
Then it slowed down.

18
00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:31.010
"Whew!" Mo said.

19
00:01:31.011 --> 00:01:36.429
Suddenly Sally pointed up high. "I see it!

20
00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.232
My egg case!"

21
00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:45.608
The egg case was caught on a rock.

22
00:01:45.609 --> 00:01:49.561
Sally tried to reach up with her tail.

23
00:01:49.562 --> 00:01:53.366
"Ugh! I'll never reach up there!"

24
00:01:53.367 --> 00:02:00.236
"I'll try something." Mo puffed himself up big.

25
00:02:00.237 --> 00:02:03.168
He squirted water at the case.

26
00:02:03.169 --> 00:02:07.833
But that didn't help.

27
00:02:07.834 --> 00:02:12.895
"Let me try." Cora reached up with an arm.

28
00:02:12.896 --> 00:02:17.945
But another wave rushed into the cave.

29
00:02:17.946 --> 00:02:21.914
Everyone was swept deeper inside!

